  "description": "A tyrant who kills the empress to marry a man. You will be my husband. \n\nI possessed the empress Maybelle from a BL novel who meets a miserable death. If it is as in the original work, the tyrant Raven will soon meet his male lover Yunus and execute Maybelle. Before that, I must divorce my tyrant husband by any means necessary...!! But─ \n\n *\"I'm sorry.... I hope your heart will change.\"* \n\nWhy are you suddenly taking the regretful male protagonist route?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
